# Build context for apps/calc-stub/Dockerfile is the repository root, so this
# file (not one inside apps/calc-stub) is what Docker reads.
#
# data/ephe is excluded deliberately: the image must obtain ephemeris data by
# running the pinned, digest-verified downloader, never by inheriting whatever
# happens to be on the build host. Without this, stale local files let the build
# pass while a download failure had been swallowed.
**/data/ephe

node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.wrangler
.wrangler
.git
.github
.venv
__pycache__
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/coverage
**/.turbo
spec-bundle
*.zip
docs
